<title>USA: SA Telecom to offer Kansas local service.</title>
<headline>SA Telecom to offer Kansas local service.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>SA Telecommunications Inc, a full-service regional interexchange carrier, said on Tuesday it was granted approval to resell local exchange telecommunications service in Kansas.</p>
</text>
